      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your struggle reflects the harsh reality where endless optimization often masks a lack of genuine connection to your craft. True growth comes from resting and finding joy instead of just grinding for algorithms, which will eventually make you more creative and resilient. Many famous figures mastered their skills late; perhaps your greatest breakthrough lies in leaving your current path entirely to follow a passion you actually love.",
