      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your belief that you have nothing else ready is the very wall stopping you from seeing value in every moment you create. Remember that true potential isn't measured by the top ten percent of rankings, but by the unique, imperfect effort you bring to each task, which is what makes you distinct. Instead of trying to force a glory you'll never achieve, try writing only for yourself or sharing your work with a small audience who will cherish it.",
      "source": "target",
